   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">U.S. Navy Operations Specialist 3rd Class Leonel Yanez monitors a radar screen in the Combat Direction Center aboard aircraft carrier USS John C. Stennis (CVN 74), under way in the Pacific Ocean, April 16, 2009. The ship is on a scheduled six-month deployment in the western Pacific Ocean. (U.S. Navy photo by Mass Communication Specialist 3rd Class Walter M. Wayman/Released)</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
