   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">An F-117A Nighthawk stealth fighter from the 49th Fighter Wing, 9th Fighter Squadron "Iron Knights,"  Holloman Air Force Base, New Mexico, flys a training mission over the New Mexico desert.  One of the only two operational Nighthawk Squadrons, the 9th deploys worldwide using special low observable technologies to deliver precision guided weapons against heavily defended targets.  This photograph is from the October 1999 issue of Airman Magazine.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
   <dc:creator>
    <rdf:Seq>
     <rdf:li>SSGT Andy Dunaway, USAF</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Seq>
