   </dc:creator>
   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">An F-35 Lightning II aircraft flies over Eglin Air Force Base, Fla., April 23, 2009. The aircraft is the first of its type to visit the base, which will be the future home of the Joint Strike Fighter training facility. (DoD photo by Senior Airman Julianne Showalter, U.S. Air Force/Released) </rdf:li>
